5,1,1,talk,Midori,,"We need to agree on what ""success"" looks like before we even look at the vendors.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,Success means the freight keeps moving when the system changes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,And that the new thing doesn't just quietly rot in place like the last one did.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,And that the people running the floor aren't left holding the bag when it breaks.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,And that the price tag doesn't quietly triple once the contract is signed and the cameras stop rolling.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that post-signature creep is exactly the kind of hidden cost that derails a project.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, rotting in place is exactly what happens when we ignore the yard equipment.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, exactly. We need to verify if the new system can actually talk to those aging yard devices before we commit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the equipment is a problem, but the people operating it are the real bottleneck.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, the people are the bottleneck, but the money is the fuel. I need to see where the budget actually goes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, agreed. Let’s each pick two things to dig into so we cover all our bases.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, I’ll check the depot calendar and the yard devices. We can’t ignore the physical reality of our operations.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll pull the dispatch tool’s upgrade history and the 2018 pay move data. I need to see how we handle aging systems and messy data migrations.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I’ll look into the administrator retirements and the depot supervisors. I need to know who is actually left to carry this.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll review the board minutes and the five years of renewal invoices. I need to see how we actually fund these things.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,I’ll check the support ownership during last winter’s outage and the warehouse rule changes. I need to see where responsibility breaks down.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
